    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SYDNEY\nDong King the beetly the mor\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nAUSTRALIA can provide the visitor with a range of experiences from attending cultural events in the\nSydney Opera House, pictured here, to visiting aboriginal tribes in the Outback. This continent, as\nlarge as the United States, encompasses many aspects; The Great Barrier Reef, marvelous skiing in\nJuly just 200 miles south of Sydney; bountiful gems and strange animals and birds. Unique flora and\nfauna are here in marvelous abundance. Pan Am serves Sydney and Melbourne from Los Angeles,\nSan Francisco, New York, London, Auckland, Honolulu, and Nadi.\nPAN AM.\n2001,080, 251",
      "SYDNEY\nKinG min\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktails\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini\nVermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nAperitivo\nApéritif\nDelícias Culinarias\nSelected gourmet delicacies\nAsado del Día\nA selected cut of aged beef, lamb or other succulent meat\nroasted on board and carved to order.\nYour flight attendant will advise you of today's roast\nMedallones de Ternera con Hongos\nSautéed veal escalopes with fresh forest mushrooms\nPechuga de Pollo Smitane\nSupreme of young pullet in a spritely brown sauce with a hint of sour cream\nFiletes de Lenguado Primavera\nDelicate wine poached sole fillets with a julienne of fresh vegetables\nPlato del Dia\nSpeciality of the day\nPapas a la Casera\nPotatoes Maison\nLegumbres en Mantequilla\nButtered vegetable bouquet\nEnsalada Campestre\nTossed garden salad\nSelección de Quesos y Frutas\nSelected fruits and cheeses\nPostre\nDessert\nCafé\nCoffee\nCafé Descafeinado\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nArroz Pilaf\nPilaf rice\nTea\nSelected Red and White Wines\nChampagne Brut\nDrambuie\nBénédictine Crème de Menthe\nCognac Napoléon Contreau\nKahlúa\nAmaretto di Saronno"
    ],
